      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source deploys a layered diagnostic scheme: growth and non-tempered pairing exclude trivial-zero states from the proposed domain, self-orthogonal Jordan coalescence diagnoses off-critical zeros inside the formal spectral model, infinite norm blocks a Hilbert-space interpretation, and missing completeness blocks identification of the formal adjoint and any self-adjoint realization.",
